{"seq":3,"slug":"algorithms","title":"算法：把 ELBO 真正优化出来","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mean-field","title":"平均场近似：用独立性换来可解性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/algorithms/mean-field","wordCount":1553,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"cavi","title":"坐标上升 CAVI：把最优因子公式跑成算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/algorithms/cavi","wordCount":1406,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"stochastic-vi","title":"随机变分推断 SVI：把 VI 推向海量数据与任意模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/algorithms/stochastic-vi","wordCount":1531,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"算法-把-elbo-真正优化出来\">算法：把 ELBO 真正优化出来</h1><p>目标函数在 ELBO 章已经定死，这一章只关心一件事：给定一个具体模型，如何把 ELBO 最大化到底。三篇文档构成一条从「结构假设」到「闭式更新」再到「随机可扩展」的清晰演化线。</p>\n<p>第一篇《平均场近似》先解决「在哪个分布族里优化」的问题。平均场是变分推断里用得最多的一个假设：把联合的近似后验拆成各隐变量独立因子的乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(z)=\\prod_i q_i(z_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个假设让优化变得可行，也带来了代价——它切断了隐变量之间的后验相关性，是变分近似低估方差的结构性根源。这一篇推导在平均场约束下单个因子的最优形态。</p>\n<p>第二篇《坐标上升》把平均场的最优因子公式变成一个能跑的算法 CAVI（Coordinate Ascent Variational Inference）：轮流固定其它因子、更新当前因子，每一步都保证 ELBO 不降。在条件共轭的指数族模型里，这些更新是闭式的，本篇用高斯混合模型作为贯穿示例，把抽象公式落到具体更新式上。</p>\n<p>第三篇《随机变分推断》突破 CAVI 的两个瓶颈：一是它要扫全量数据、无法处理海量样本，二是它依赖共轭、遇到非共轭模型就卡住。SVI 用随机梯度（小批量估计 ELBO 梯度）解决前者，用自然梯度加速收敛，并借助自动微分与黑盒/摊销技巧把 VI 推广到几乎任意可微模型——这也是 Pyro、NumPyro、TensorFlow Probability 等现代工具的默认引擎。</p>\n<p>学完本章，你手里就有了从「小模型闭式解」到「大模型随机解」的完整算法谱系；重参数化等让随机梯度真正低方差的技巧，留给实践章展开。</p>\n"}